     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Two Environmental management and protection policies, 1 bill and 4 Acts of same are under review. The Two Policies include; The National Env. Policy, The Climate Change policy &amp; the bill include the National Protected Area Authority &amp; conservation Trust Fund bill. The 4 Acts includes, the Forestry Act 1998, Wildlife Conservation Act 1972, EPA Act 2008/2010, &amp; the Climate change Act. The Ministry of Environment has produced the first draft of Five of the revised policies and bills;

